<title>USA: SBC board rescinds stock buyback plans.</title>
<headline>SBC board rescinds stock buyback plans.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Communications Inc Friday said its board has voted to rescind all of the company's stock repurchase authorizations.</p>
<p>The measure was taken to ensure compliance with pooling of interests accounting requirements associated with the pending merger of Pacific Telesis Group into a unit of SBC.</p>
</text>
